# Example secret contract for the platform-gateway deployment (SPEC-008 R-3/R-7,
# SPEC-010). Copy to runtime-secrets.env (never committed) and replace the
# placeholder, or let CI inject the real value. Sync into the cluster as the
# optional Secret 'platform-gateway-runtime-secrets' referenced by the
# platform-gateway deployment.
#
# The value must match the client secret registered on the identity-broker
# (IDENTITY_SERVICE_CLIENTS). It confers no user authority on its own; it only
# authorizes the token-exchange operation.
#
# This static secret is the dev fallback. Non-dev deployments should prefer the
# projected workload-identity token (SPEC-009): set
# PLATFORM_GATEWAY_WORKLOAD_TOKEN_PATH to the mounted token file and register
# the workload subject on the broker (see
# shared/platform-ops/gitops/dev-k8s/README.md).
PLATFORM_GATEWAY_SERVICE_CLIENT_SECRET=replace-with-platform-gateway-service-client-secret
